#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/dev/RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem.java[`io.quarkus.deployment.dev.RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem`, window=\"_blank\"]\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Defines the relationship between classes for the purposes of recompilation. <p/> Idea is that multiple classes can be dependent on one other class. For this BuildItem a class can be an outermost class, a nested class, an annotation, an interface, an enum, or basically anything that has an FQN. A consolidation step in `RecompilationDependenciesProcessor` cleans up the collected recompilation dependencies and removes duplicates. <p/> The collected recompilation dependencies are used to build a relationship tree between the classes in the `RuntimeUpdatesProcessor` , which is build and traversed from the root up and outwards. Class a -> Set of Class -> where each element class can resolve to another set of classes. <p/> The collected recompilation dependencies are used to determine the set of classes which need to additionally be recompiled when one other class changes. <p/> For performance reasons, the scope of the collected recompilation dependencies should be quite narrow. For an example, the quarkus-mapstruct extension uses this BuildItem to recompile the dependent Mapper classes, once any of the referenced model classes changes.\n"
"--"
msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/dev/RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem.java[io.quarkus.deployment.dev.RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem]"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/dev/RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem.java[`io.quarkus.deployment.dev.RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem`, window=\"_blank\"]"
msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/core/deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/deployment/dev/RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem.java[io.quarkus.deployment.dev.RecompilationDependenciesBuildItem]"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Defines the relationship between classes for the purposes of recompilation. <p/> Idea is that multiple classes can be dependent on one other class. For this BuildItem a class can be an outermost class, a nested class, an annotation, an interface, an enum, or basically anything that has an FQN. A consolidation step in `RecompilationDependenciesProcessor` cleans up the collected recompilation dependencies and removes duplicates. <p/> The collected recompilation dependencies are used to build a relationship tree between the classes in the `RuntimeUpdatesProcessor` , which is build and traversed from the root up and outwards. Class a -> Set of Class -> where each element class can resolve to another set of classes. <p/> The collected recompilation dependencies are used to determine the set of classes which need to additionally be recompiled when one other class changes. <p/> For performance reasons, the scope of the collected recompilation dependencies should be quite narrow. For an example, the quarkus-mapstruct extension uses this BuildItem to recompile the dependent Mapper classes, once any of the referenced model classes changes."
msgstr "定义类之间的关系，以便进行重新编译。<p/> 其设计理念是，多个类可以依赖于同一个类。对于此 BuildItem，类可以是外层类、嵌套类、注解、接口、枚举，或者基本上任何具有完全限定名称（FQN）的对象。 `RecompilationDependenciesProcessor` 中的整合步骤会清理收集到的重新编译依赖关系并移除重复项。<p/> 收集到的重新编译依赖关系用于在 `RuntimeUpdatesProcessor` 中构建类之间的关系树，该关系树是从根节点开始自上而下、由内向外构建并遍历的。 类 a → 类集合 → 其中每个元素类均可解析为另一个类集合。<p/> 收集到的重新编译依赖关系用于确定当某个类发生变化时，需要额外重新编译的类集合。 <p/> 出于性能考虑，收集到的重新编译依赖关系的范围应相当窄。例如，quarkus-mapstruct 扩展使用此 BuildItem，一旦被引用的任何模型类发生变化，便重新编译相关的 Mapper 类。"

